<title>USA: Petroleum Geo gets Mississippi Canyon work.</title>
<headline>Petroleum Geo gets Mississippi Canyon work.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Petroleum Geo-Services A/S said Tuesday it has been awarded a contract from Shell Offshore Inc for a high-resolution 3D seismic survey in the deepwater area of the Gulf of Mexico.</p>
<p>The survey will be conducted in the Mississippi Canyon area where the Royal Dutch/Shell Group subsidiary is operator for a partnership that also includes British Petroleum Co Plc, DuPont Co's Conoco and Exxon. -- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
